## Rename the per-page truncation retry budget (PR #206 review nit)
================================================================================

Context: review nit on PR #206 — `_MAX_COMPLETION_ATTEMPTS = 2` really
meant "one smaller-page retry per truncated page", which read as a total
attempt budget.

Changes:

1. `src/agents/agent_owl_generator/staged.py`
   `_MAX_COMPLETION_ATTEMPTS = 2` -> `_MAX_PAGE_TRUNCATION_RETRIES = 1`;
   the check is now `page_trunc_retries < _MAX_PAGE_TRUNCATION_RETRIES`
   (same behaviour). The comment states the counter resets on every
   accepted page.

